{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-service-architecture-embedded-vs-sidecar","title":"决策服务架构：嵌入式引擎 vs 决策服务 / OPA sidecar 与灰度接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rule-engine-model-decision-architecture/decision-service-architecture-embedded-vs-sidecar","wordCount":2723,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"决策服务架构-嵌入式引擎-vs-决策服务-opa-sidecar-与灰度接入\">决策服务架构：嵌入式引擎 vs 决策服务 / OPA sidecar 与灰度接入</h1><p>同一条 Rego 策略或 DMN 决策表，可以跑在三种完全不同的物理位置上：进程内的 Go library、宿主机的 sidecar 守护进程、或者集群另一端的决策微服务。这个选择决定了跨机房一次价格裁决是 60 微秒还是 8 毫秒，也决定了改一条风控规则时你是重启整个下单服务，还是只轮换一个 bundle。需要先定下来的不是&quot;用哪个引擎&quot;，而是&quot;决策的物理位置&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种部署形态与决策路径\">核心概念：三种部署形态与决策路径</h2><p>决策服务的形态沿一条&quot;距离轴&quot;排列：<strong>嵌入式（in-process）</strong>、<strong>本机守护进程（sidecar / host-level daemon）</strong>、<strong>远程决策服务（remote decision service）</strong>。距离越近，延迟越低、可用性越强，但策略变更与多语言支持越笨重；距离越远治理越集中，但每次裁决都要付出一次网络往返和一种新的失败模式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[业务请求] --&gt; B{决策位置}&#10;  B --&gt;|嵌入式| C[同进程规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;OPA Go library / WASM / Drools-KieSession]&#10;  B --&gt;|sidecar| D[本机守护进程&lt;br/&gt;OPA 8181 / ext_authz gRPC]&#10;  B --&gt;|远程| E[决策微服务&lt;br/&gt;Kogito / OPA cluster]&#10;  C --&gt; F[决策结果]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  G[控制面: bundle registry / DMN repo] -.-&gt;|轮询或长轮询下发| C&#10;  G -.-&gt;|下发| D&#10;  G -.-&gt;|部署| E\">graph TD\n  A[业务请求] --&gt; B{决策位置}\n  B --&gt;|嵌入式| C[同进程规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;OPA Go library / WASM / Drools-KieSession]\n  B --&gt;|sidecar| D[本机守护进程&lt;br/&gt;OPA 8181 / ext_authz gRPC]\n  B --&gt;|远程| E[决策微服务&lt;br/&gt;Kogito / OPA cluster]\n  C --&gt; F[决策结果]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  G[控制面: bundle registry / DMN repo] -.-&gt;|轮询或长轮询下发| C\n  G -.-&gt;|下发| D\n  G -.-&gt;|部署| E</pre><p>把&quot;控制面&quot;与&quot;数据面&quot;分开是这套架构的核心抽象：<strong>控制面</strong>（策略仓库、bundle registry、DMN 版本库）负责作者、审阅、签名与分发；<strong>数据面</strong>（进程内引擎、sidecar、决策微服务）只在毫秒级预算内把输入映射成输出。数据面不应该在裁决路径上去拉新策略——那会把控制面的可用性变成业务可用性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>嵌入式 library</th>\n<th>本机 sidecar / daemon</th>\n<th>远程决策服务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>裁决延迟</td>\n<td>与业务同进程，无网络段</td>\n<td>本机回环一次往返</td>\n<td>跨节点往返 + 排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略变更</td>\n<td>需重新构建/重新部署</td>\n<td>轮询 bundle 热更新</td>\n<td>独立部署，业务无感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言支持</td>\n<td>受宿主语言限制</td>\n<td>任意 HTTP/gRPC 客户端</td>\n<td>任意语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爆炸半径</td>\n<td>引擎崩溃 = 业务进程崩溃</td>\n<td>引擎崩溃可降级放行</td>\n<td>服务故障波及全部调用方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型载体</td>\n<td>OPA <code>rego</code> 包、OPA WASM、Drools <code>KieSession</code></td>\n<td>OPA-Envoy、OPA 守护进程</td>\n<td>Kogito 决策服务、OPA 集群</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"延迟预算的分解\">延迟预算的分解</h3><p>端到端裁决延迟可写成同一个和式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>ser</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>eval</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>de</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{total}} = L_{\\text{net}} + L_{\\text{ser}} + L_{\\text{eval}} + L_{\\text{de}} + L_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ser</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">de</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>eval</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是引擎求值时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是网络往返，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>ser</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{ser}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ser</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>de</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{de}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">de</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是序列化开销，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是服务端排队。嵌入式把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到 0，sidecar 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到回环级别，远程形态则让这两项成为主导。OPA 官方文档把目标决策预算描述为&quot;在 1 毫秒量级&quot;（openpolicyagent.org，Policy Performance）——一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入毫秒级，策略引擎本身再快也没有意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入式引擎-把求值器放进业务进程\">嵌入式引擎：把求值器放进业务进程</h2><p>嵌入式的前提是引擎能作为库被宿主语言调用。OPA 提供两条路径：<strong>Go library</strong>——<code>import &quot;github.com/open-policy-agent/opa/v1/rego&quot;</code>，<code>PrepareForEval</code> 得到的 prepared query 被缓存在内存、在多个 goroutine 间共享、可被不同输入反复调用；以及 <strong>WASM</strong>——用 <code>opa build -t wasm -e example/allow</code> 把某个 entrypoint 编译成独立模块，配合 <code>npm-opa-wasm</code> 之类的 SDK 在非 Go 语言里执行。WASM 编译的是&quot;某个 entrypoint 的求值计划&quot;而非把 OPA 服务端搬进 WASM；<code>http.send</code> 这类依赖宿主能力的 built-in 永远无法原生支持，必须由宿主实现并通过 <code>opa_builtin0</code>–<code>opa_builtin4</code> 回调注入，ABI 1.3 起还提供堆指针与 stash/restore 函数用于反复求值时避免内存泄漏。选 WASM 就等于承诺&quot;策略不发起任何外部调用&quot;。</p>\n<p>嵌入式最容易被低估的成本是<strong>资源核算</strong>。OPA 文档给出的经验值：加载到内存的 JSON 约占紧凑序列化数据的 <strong>20 倍</strong>（8 MB JSON → 约 160 MB 常驻），规则数量近似线性——<strong>1 万条 ACL 规则约 130 MB，10 万条约 1.1 GB</strong>。把它嵌进已跑着业务逻辑的进程时这些内存与业务共享；容器 <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 若仍按原业务峰值设置，很容易被引擎堆增长触发 OOM Kill。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽略的替代品是 <strong>CEL</strong>。当策略只是&quot;字段校验 + 简单谓词&quot;而不需要完整规则引擎时，CEL 以 non-Turing-complete、保证终止、无副作用为设计前提（google/cel-spec，Language Definition），这正是它能被安全内嵌到不可信输入路径上的原因。Kubernetes 的 <code>ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</code> 就是这条路线：每个 CEL 表达式在创建时做最坏情况成本估计，<strong>超过 10,000,000 成本单位</strong>直接拒绝，<strong>超过 10,000 成本单位</strong>给出警告；运行时按同一预算跟踪实际消耗，并用约 <strong>1 秒</strong>挂钟截止时间兜底，失控求值被当作错误终止而非返回 false。这是一个值得照抄的模板：<strong>为进程内求值设定可计算的成本预算，而不是相信策略作者会写出有界的表达式。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"决策服务与-sidecar-把引擎移出进程\">决策服务与 sidecar：把引擎移出进程</h2><p>当策略需要跨语言复用，或变更频率高到&quot;重启业务进程&quot;不可接受时，引擎就该搬到本机守护进程或独立服务。</p>\n<p><strong>sidecar 形态</strong>最成熟的实现是 OPA-Envoy：Envoy 的 External Authorization（<code>ext_authz</code>）filter 拦截请求，通过 gRPC 调用 OPA-Envoy 服务，OPA 拿到来源、目标、HTTP 请求细节后求值 <code>data.envoy.authz.allow</code>（默认路径 <code>envoy/authz/allow</code>），返回布尔值或含 <code>allowed</code> 的对象，并可附带 <code>headers</code>、<code>body</code>、<code>http_status</code> 自定义 Envoy 响应。文档明确说明 OPA-Envoy 通常与 Envoy sidecar 一起跑在应用 Pod 内，<strong>授权在本地求值、避免额外的网络跳数</strong>，也能作为独立进程跑在 Kubernetes 之外；其价值在于&quot;不修改业务微服务即可实施授权&quot;。</p>\n<p>Istio 沿用同一套 <code>ext_authz</code> 机制，因为 Istio 数据面本身就是 Envoy。值得注意的架构演进是 <strong>ambient 模式</strong>（Istio 1.31.1 文档）：节点级 <strong>ztunnel</strong> 负责 L4 安全覆盖、mTLS 与流量重定向，可选的 <strong>waypoint</strong> 代理提供 L7 能力，流量走 HBONE 隧道。这改变了 sidecar 拓扑——ambient 下不再有 per-pod sidecar 可以&quot;蹭&quot;，策略引擎要么绑到 waypoint 上，要么退回远程或嵌入式。</p>\n<p><strong>策略分发</strong>在 sidecar 形态下就是 bundle 机制。OPA 通过 <code>GET /&lt;service-path&gt;/&lt;resource&gt;</code> 轮询远端（成功响应为 HTTP 200 + <code>Content-Type: application/gzip</code>）；bundle 是 gzip 压缩的 tar 包，<code>.rego</code> 按 package 路径进入 <code>data</code> 文档，只有名为 <code>data.json</code> 或 <code>data.yaml</code> 的文件才被加载，可选 <code>.manifest</code> 携带 <code>revision</code>、<code>roots</code>、<code>wasm</code> 等元数据。轮询分短轮询（<code>polling.min_delay_seconds</code> / <code>max_delay_seconds</code>）与长轮询（<code>long_polling_timeout_seconds</code>），服务端应返回 <code>Etag</code>，未变更时回 <code>304 Not Modified</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant S as OPA sidecar&#10;  participant R as Bundle Registry&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;R: GET /bundles/app (If-None-Match: Etag)&#10;  R--&gt;&gt;S: 304 Not Modified&#10;  R--&gt;&gt;S: 200 + 新 bundle (revision 变更)&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;S: 校验签名并原子激活\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant S as OPA sidecar\n  participant R as Bundle Registry\n  S-&gt;&gt;R: GET /bundles/app (If-None-Match: Etag)\n  R--&gt;&gt;S: 304 Not Modified\n  R--&gt;&gt;S: 200 + 新 bundle (revision 变更)\n  S-&gt;&gt;S: 校验签名并原子激活</pre><p><strong>签名</strong>与<strong>持久化</strong>两个细节决定了这套机制在事故中的表现：签名 bundle 附带 <code>.signatures.json</code>（含逐个文件名称、哈希与算法的 JWT 数组），配置了校验时不接受未签名 bundle，失败时 OPA <strong>保留现有 bundle</strong> 并把激活失败写入 status 与日志；<code>persist: true</code> 把最近一次成功激活的 bundle 存到 <code>./.opa/bundles/&lt;bundle-name&gt;/</code> 用于启动恢复。这些&quot;失败时保留旧版本&quot;的语义是 sidecar 相较远程服务最大的可靠性优势：<strong>控制面挂了，数据面还能用旧策略继续裁决。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"灰度接入-从-shadow-到-canary-的三段式\">灰度接入：从 shadow 到 canary 的三段式</h2><p>把策略从旧位置迁到新位置，或把一次规则变更放进生产，风险都源于同一件事：<strong>决策结果改变会立刻改变业务行为</strong>。可控路径分三段推进。</p>\n<p><strong>第一段：shadow / 双跑。</strong> 新引擎与旧实现同时收到同一份输入，但只有旧实现的结果被采纳，用这一段收集 <strong>决策分歧率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\frac{\\#\\{x : f_{\\text{old}}(x) \\neq f_{\\text{new}}(x)\\}}{\\#\\{x\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>必须让每个分歧样本可归因——记录输入摘要、两条策略的 revision、以及两者的输出。没有归因能力的分歧率只是一个数字，无法定位是策略移植错误还是索引语义差异。\n<strong>第二段：canary / 按比例切换。</strong> 分歧率收敛到可接受区间后，按流量比例把一部分请求交给新引擎。关键在<strong>决策位置与流量切分要对齐</strong>：sidecar 形态下可按 Pod、namespace、Envoy route 权重来切；远程决策服务形态天然更容易做金丝雀，因为切换发生在调用方与服务之间。这一阶段要盯的是 p99 而非延迟均值——OPA 的 RBAC 基准（<code>opa bench</code>，仅求值、不含加载/解析/编译）约 <strong>27,295 个样本、平均 45,032 ns/op、中位数 35,846 ns、p99 133,936 ns、max 336,493 ns</strong>，平均与 p99 差了三倍，用均值判断&quot;是否变慢&quot;会漏掉真正的尾延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>第三段：全量与回滚演练。</strong> 全量之前必须验证回滚路径真实可用。对 bundle 形态，回滚 = 把 registry 的 revision 指回旧版本，等所有 sidecar 的下一个轮询周期取到；因此<strong>回滚时间上界 ≈ 轮询最大间隔</strong>，<code>max_delay_seconds</code> 设得越长回滚越慢。对远程决策服务，回滚是一次部署；对嵌入式，回滚是一次业务服务发布——这是嵌入式在灰度能力上最实质的劣势。守住延迟预算的并行手段包括 <code>opa build --optimize</code> 的 <code>-O=1</code>（求值并内联与 unknown 无关的规则，<code>input</code> 自动视为 unknown）与规则索引（前缀匹配存放于基数树，&quot;十条前缀和一万条前缀的查找成本相同&quot;），它们直接决定 canary 阶段能否守住延迟目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>决策服务的本质选择是<strong>物理位置</strong>：嵌入式、sidecar、远程服务，三者在延迟、可用性、变更成本、爆炸半径上互为取舍。</li>\n<li>端到端延迟可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>ser</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>eval</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>de</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}} + L_{\\text{ser}} + L_{\\text{eval}} + L_{\\text{de}} + L_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ser</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">de</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；嵌入式消掉网络与排队两项，远程形态则让这两项成为主导。</li>\n<li>嵌入式（OPA Go library / WASM / Drools <code>KieSession</code>）延迟最低，但要自行核算内存——JSON 常驻约为紧凑序列化的 20 倍，1 万条 ACL 规则约 130 MB；WASM 不支持 <code>http.send</code> 等宿主相关 built-in。</li>\n<li>CEL 是&quot;轻量进程内求值&quot;的成熟范式：non-Turing-complete、保证终止、无副作用，可配可计算的成本预算（Kubernetes 用 10,000,000 成本单位硬上限与约 1 秒挂钟截止）。</li>\n<li>sidecar 形态（OPA-Envoy + Envoy <code>ext_authz</code>）不改业务代码即可实施授权；bundle 的签名校验与&quot;失败时保留旧 bundle&quot;语义，使控制面故障不直接变成业务故障。</li>\n<li>灰度接入按 shadow（测分歧率并归因）→ canary（按比例切换、盯 p99）→ 全量（先验证回滚）三段推进；bundle 形态的回滚时间上界约等于轮询最大间隔。</li>\n<li>选型判定顺序：<strong>延迟预算 → 变更频率 → 宿主语言多样性 → 爆炸半径容忍度 → 治理成本</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后续章节：<code>../2_rete-incremental-evaluation/INDEX.md</code> 讨论增量匹配如何影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>eval</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{eval}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<code>../3_dmn-decision-table-expression/INDEX.md</code> 讨论 DMN 决策表与表达式建模，<code>../4_rule-governance-testing-ops/INDEX.md</code> 讨论规则治理、测试与运维闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"决策服务架构：嵌入式引擎 vs 决策服务 / OPA sidecar 与灰度接入","id":"决策服务架构-嵌入式引擎-vs-决策服务-opa-sidecar-与灰度接入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种部署形态与决策路径","id":"核心概念-三种部署形态与决策路径"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟预算的分解","id":"延迟预算的分解"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入式引擎：把求值器放进业务进程","id":"嵌入式引擎-把求值器放进业务进程"},{"level":2,"text":"决策服务与 sidecar：把引擎移出进程","id":"决策服务与-sidecar-把引擎移出进程"},{"level":2,"text":"灰度接入：从 shadow 到 canary 的三段式","id":"灰度接入-从-shadow-到-canary-的三段式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事实模型、工作内存与规则语言表达力（DRL / CEL / Rego 语义对比）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rule-engine-model-decision-architecture/fact-model-working-memory-rule-language"},"next":{"title":"RETE 网络拓扑：alpha/beta 节点、join 连接与记忆结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rete-incremental-evaluation/rete-network-alpha-beta-node-topology"}}